      <div class="tabpanel on" id="p-mac" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-mac">
        <div class="cmdline"><code>brew install --cask fauxfield</code><button class="copy" data-copy="brew install --cask fauxfield">Copy</button></div>
        <div class="cmdline"><code>brew install 0funct0ry/tap/fauxfield-cli</code><button class="copy" data-copy="brew install 0funct0ry/tap/fauxfield-cli">Copy</button></div>
        <p>The cask installs the app and the <code>fauxfield</code> command. The formula is the headless CLI only. Signed and notarised; Apple silicon and Intel.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tabpanel" id="p-linux" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-linux">
        <div class="cmdline"><code>curl -fsSL https://0funct0ry.github.io/fauxfield/install.sh | sh</code><button class="copy" data-copy="curl -fsSL https://0funct0ry.github.io/fauxfield/install.sh | sh">Copy</button></div>
        <p>Also available as .deb, .rpm, AppImage, and a static headless build. Needs Vulkan; X11 and Wayland are supported.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tabpanel" id="p-win" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-win">
        <div class="cmdline"><code>winget install 0funct0ry.Fauxfield</code><button class="copy" data-copy="winget install 0funct0ry.Fauxfield">Copy</button></div>
        <div class="cmdline"><code>irm https://0funct0ry.github.io/fauxfield/install.ps1 | iex</code><button class="copy" data-copy="irm https://0funct0ry.github.io/fauxfield/install.ps1 | iex">Copy</button></div>
