      <div class="tabpanel" id="p-docker" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-docker">
        <div class="cmdline"><code>docker run -p 3001:3001 -v "$PWD:/workspace" ghcr.io/0funct0ry/fauxfield</code><button class="copy" data-copy='docker run -p 3001:3001 -v "$PWD:/workspace" ghcr.io/0funct0ry/fauxfield'>Copy</button></div>
        <p>The image runs <code>fauxfield run /workspace</code> with the headless build. Add <code>--env staging</code> to pick an environment.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:8px"><a href={release.url}>All downloads and checksums</a>{release.tag && <span> (latest {release.tag})</span>}</p>
